    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Your omni-tool is an extension of your nervous system. Your tech powers deal <strong>+6 damage</strong> to each creature they damage (replacing the +4 from Improved Tech Mastery), and the cooldowns of your tech powers are <strong>2 rounds shorter</strong>, to a minimum of 2 rounds (replacing the 1 round from Improved Tech Mastery). Your deep system knowledge also grants a <strong>+1 circumstance bonus to Will saves</strong>.</p><p><em>Prerequisite: Improved Tech Mastery. Classes: Engineer, Infiltrator, Sentinel.</em></p><hr/><p><em>Automation: The damage bonus is added when a creature rolls its save against the power and the module applies the damage. Add it by hand to power damage you roll yourself. Using a tech power puts its cooldown on your sheet as an effect, with the shorter cooldown counted. The Will bonus is applied automatically.</em></p>"
    },
